  "description": "“Coco is a timid tiger. Please be my friend..”  \nCoco goes to kindergarten for the first time. Kindergarten is full of daunting trials for timid Coco... Wow! My partner, please help me..~  \nTiger Coco's harmless adjustment to kindergarten that reminds us of our childhood!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=825415), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11141169)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003885)",
